{"ts":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Outcome\npm SDK primitives — typed items, custom status graphs, a relationship registry, immutable event history, point-in-time reconstruction, transactional multi-item commits, and bounded graph queries — are sufficient to model domains that have nothing to do with software backlogs.\n\n## Evidence already recorded\nTwo exemplars landed and closed: a git-like version-control extension and a temporal digital-twin phase-2 exemplar. Their gap reports named the missing primitives; the transaction waiver has since been retired. This milestone tracks the remaining distance.\n\n## Delivery chain\npm-8jdc schema/config completion (incl. pm-z5nb, pm-dijg migrations) -> pm-xc68 policy roles -> pm-is1a federation -> a third foreign-domain exemplar with an empty gap ledger. Depends on the SDK-complete milestone being reached first.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNo domain-specific policy in core. Exemplars are conformance vehicles, not products."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-t4d7nz"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Outcome milestone: universal domain platform — non-PM systems are buildable on pm SDK primitives alone"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Milestone"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["digital-twin","extensibility","horizon:far","milestone","outcome","sdk","universal-tool"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2028-06-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":12000},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Custom types, statuses, workflows, fields, and relationship kinds are fully definable at runtime with lossless migration; Principal-based item-level policy is enforced at the SDK layer, not per-surface; Cross-workspace federation supports context, dependencies, and aggregation across many repositories; A published exemplar outside project management ships with an empty SDK gap ledger; Project profiles let a workspace be reshaped for a non-software domain without editing core"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"universal-domain-platform"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"A developer models a foreign domain — version control, business workflows, a digital twin — using only public pm SDK primitives"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Proves the central product claim: pm is an event-sourced, graph-native context substrate, and project management is one application of it."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Opens the addressable surface beyond software backlogs and turns the extension ecosystem into a platform rather than a plugin list."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"At least three foreign-domain exemplars ship with no core forks, no private-core imports, and a published gap ledger that is empty."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The first two exemplars (a git-like VCS and a temporal digital twin) already shipped and produced a gap report; the remaining gaps decide whether the platform claim is real or aspirational."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-doxj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-8jdc","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"},{"id":"pm-dijg","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"},{"id":"pm-is1a","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"},{"id":"pm-m08hza","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"},{"id":"pm-ugqx","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"},{"id":"pm-xc68","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"},{"id":"pm-z5nb","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:02.049Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"2e5406fee2f6a480cc03d9351b7a8bc18759e541b45b90416e0fdb953514b9ca","message":"File outcome milestone for the universal-platform horizon"}
